menu "Home WiFi"

    config STA_SSID
        string "WiFi network name (2.4 GHz)"
        default ""
        help
            Every board joins this network. The TX and all RXs then share its
            channel, which is the sensing channel. Leave empty here and set it
            per board over serial with STASSID: <name>, so it isn't committed.

    config STA_PASSWORD
        string "WiFi password"
        default ""
        help
            Set over serial with STAPASS: <password>. Stored in the board's
            NVS; never printed back.

endmenu

menu "Sensing (TX)"

    config PACKET_RATE
        int "Packet TX Rate (packets per second)"
        default "100"
        range 1 1000
        help
            The TX broadcasts this many ESP-NOW frames per second; each RX
            produces one CSI record per frame. Serial command RATE: <n>
            changes it live.

endmenu
